==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)|Kabuto Cat]], [[Kuwagata Cat (Special Cat)|Kuwagata Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N202 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N202]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is unprecedently difficult without a high level [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)|Golden Kabuto Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N202 (Special Cat)|Armored Firefly Cat]]. It is recommended to boost the former to Lv.40 to ensure he can tank hits from Bore, with the only strategy being to spam them with Research [[Cat Combo]]s alongside the occasional Armored Firefly Cat for Weaken procs.

